<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>X Clone - Post Details</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body { overflow-y: scroll; }
        .hover-bg:hover { background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .nav-link { color: #0f1419; font-size: 1.25rem; border-radius: 50px; padding: 12px 20px; transition: 0.2s; }
        .nav-link:hover { background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .nav-link i { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-right: 15px; }
        .tweet-border { border-bottom: 1px solid #eff3f4; }
        .sticky-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid #eff3f4; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid" style="max-width: 1280px;">
        <div class="row">
            
            <!-- Sidebar Left -->
            <div class="col-2 col-md-3 col-xl-2 d-flex flex-column sticky-top vh-100 py-2 ps-md-4 pe-2">
                <a href="home.html" class="d-inline-block p-2 mb-3 mt-1 text-dark">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 30px; fill: #0f1419;"><g><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 22.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></g></svg>
                </a>
                <nav class="nav flex-column gap-1 mb-auto">
                    <a href="home.html" class="nav-link fw-bold d-flex align-items-center"><i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i> <span class="d-none d-md-inline">Home</span></a>
                    <a href="explore.html" class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center"><i class="bi bi-search"></i> <span class="d-none d-md-inline">Explore</span></a>
                    <a href="profile.html" class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center"><i class="bi bi-person"></i> <span class="d-none d-md-inline">Profile</span></a>
                </nav>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Content: Tweet Details -->
            <main class="col-10 col-md-9 col-xl-6 border-start border-end p-0 min-vh-100">
                
                <!-- Header -->
                <div class="sticky-header p-2 d-flex align-items-center">
                    <a href="home.html" class="btn btn-light border-0 rounded-circle me-4 p-2 fs-5 hover-bg"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i></a>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-0 lh-1">Post</h4>
                </div>

                <!-- Main Tweet -->
                <div class="p-3 tweet-border">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                            <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Elon+Musk&background=0D8ABC&color=fff" class="rounded-circle me-3" width="48" height="48">
                            <div class="lh-sm">
                                <div class="fw-bold">Elon Musk <i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill text-primary"></i></div>
                                <div class="text-secondary small">@elonmusk</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <i class="bi bi-three-dots text-secondary p-2 hover-bg rounded-circle"></i>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p class="fs-4 mb-3">Rebuilding the UI with separate files using Bootstrap 5 makes the codebase much cleaner and easier to manage in Node.js! 🚀</p>
                    
                    <div class="text-secondary pb-3 tweet-border small">
                        8:18 AM · Apr 28, 2026 · <span class="fw-bold text-dark">15.2M</span> Views
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap py-3 tweet-border text-secondary small gap-4">
                        <div><span class="text-dark fw-bold">12K</span> Reposts</div>
                        <div><span class="text-dark fw-bold">400</span> Quotes</div>
                        <div><span class="text-dark fw-bold">145K</span> Likes</div>
                        <div><span class="text-dark fw-bold">80</span> Bookmarks</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-around py-2 tweet-border text-secondary fs-5">
                        <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-circle text-primary"><i class="bi bi-chat"></i></div>
                        <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-circle text-success"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i></div>
                        <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-circle text-danger"><i class="bi bi-heart"></i></div>
                        <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-circle text-primary"><i class="bi bi-bookmark"></i></div>
                        <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-circle text-primary"><i class="bi bi-upload"></i></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Post a Reply -->
                    <div class="d-flex mt-3 pt-2">
                        <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=John+Doe&background=random" class="rounded-circle me-3" width="48" height="48">
                        <div class="w-100">
                            <textarea class="form-control border-0 fs-5 px-0 shadow-none bg-transparent" rows="1" placeholder="Post your reply"></textarea>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2">
                                <div class="text-primary fs-5 d-flex gap-1">
                                    <i class="bi bi-image hover-bg rounded-circle p-2"></i>
                                </div>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill px-4 fw-bold">Reply</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Comment Thread -->
                <div class="p-3 tweet-border hover-bg d-flex">
                    <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Jane+Smith&background=random" class="rounded-circle me-3" width="40" height="40">
                    <div class="w-100">
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                            <div>
                                <span class="fw-bold">Jane Smith</span>
                                <span class="text-secondary small">@janesmith · 1h</span>
                            </div>
                            <i class="bi bi-three-dots text-secondary p-2 hover-bg rounded-circle"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mb-2">Absolutely agree! Separating concerns makes full-stack development so much easier.</p>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between text-secondary mt-2 pe-md-5 small">
                            <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-pill text-primary"><i class="bi bi-chat me-2"></i>12</div>
                            <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-pill text-success"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-2"></i>2</div>
                            <div class="hover-bg p-2 rounded-pill text-danger"><i class="bi bi-heart-fill text-danger me-2"></i>150</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </main>
            <!-- Right Sidebar Blank Placeholder -->
            <aside class="col-xl-4 d-none d-xl-block py-3 ps-4 pe-lg-5"></aside>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
